1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
天空为什么是蓝色的？
Why is the sky blue?

2
00:00:01,728 --> 00:00:04,864
我们问了同一个小语言模型的两个版本
We asked two versions of the same small language model.

3
00:00:05,184 --> 00:00:08,747
两个回答都来自课程团队保存的 Colab 运行
Both answers come from the course staff's saved Colab run.

4
00:00:08,983 --> 00:00:11,159
原版的回答像教科书
The original answers like a textbook.

5
00:00:11,479 --> 00:00:14,433
微调后的那个，开口先来一句奶酪味十足的问候
The fine-tuned one opens with a cheesy greeting

6
00:00:14,433 --> 00:00:17,261
用的是授课老师的口吻，然后才解释
in the instructor's voice, and then explains.

7
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,100
再看物理
Now check the physics.

8
00:00:19,228 --> 00:00:22,385
一个怪折射，另一个怪水分子
One blames refraction, the other water molecules.

9
00:00:22,705 --> 00:00:26,375
两个都错了：空气分子对蓝光的散射比对红光更强
Both are wrong: air molecules scatter blue light more than red.

10
00:00:26,695 --> 00:00:30,151
口吻完全变了；事实却没有变好
The voice changed completely; the facts did not get better.

11
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:33,032
聊天模型的习惯也是这样学来的
Chat models learn their habits the same way;

12
00:00:33,032 --> 00:00:36,800
课上展示过一个，开口总是 Sure, here's
the lecture shows one that starts with the words, Sure, here's.

13
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:43,947
这个模型冻结了 5.96 亿个权重，只训练了 115 万个新的
This one kept 596 million weights frozen and trained 1.15 million new ones.

14
00:00:44,267 --> 00:00:50,731
在 A100 上用了大约三分半钟，存下来的文件大约 4.6 MB
It took about 3 and a half minutes on an A100, and fits in a file of about 4.6 megabytes.

15
00:00:50,967 --> 00:00:53,036
那它学到了什么，又没学到什么？
So what did it learn, and what didn't it?

16
00:00:53,356 --> 00:00:54,956
两条路线来回答这个问题
Two tracks answer that.

17
00:00:55,106 --> 00:00:59,098
路线 A 走 README：由 Gemini 写一份人设数据集
In track A, the README, Gemini writes a persona dataset

18
00:00:59,098 --> 00:01:01,420
再由 Google 替你微调 Gemini
and Google tunes Gemini for you.

19
00:01:01,740 --> 00:01:03,582
路线 B 走课程的 Colab
In track B, the course Colab,

20
00:01:03,582 --> 00:01:07,265
你自己微调一个开源模型，权重留在你手里
you fine-tune an open model yourself and keep the weights.

21
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:13,047
左上角的进度条显示当前步骤；右上角的灰色标签指向课件
The tracker, top left, shows the step; the gray tag, top right, shows the lecture slides.

22
00:01:13,367 --> 00:01:16,375
看到标签写着 your turn，就暂停，自己跑这条命令
When a tag says your turn, pause and run the command.

23
00:01:18,883 --> 00:01:23,963
有一个限制要说清楚：这段是 2026 年 10 月 31 日录的
One honest limit: we recorded this on October 31, 2026,

24
00:01:23,963 --> 00:01:27,566
没有服务账号密钥，也没有 GPU
with no service account key and no GPU.

25
00:01:27,886 --> 00:01:30,783
README 里的每条命令都照原样跑了
Every README command ran exactly as written;

26
00:01:30,783 --> 00:01:34,273
要连 Google 的命令都停在缺少密钥这一步
the ones that talk to Google stop at the missing key,

27
00:01:34,273 --> 00:01:36,248
这些真实的报错我们都保留了
and we keep those real errors.

28
00:01:36,568 --> 00:01:40,473
正常运行的输出来自 README 和课程团队保存的 Colab 运行
Working outputs come from the README and the saved Colab run.

29
00:01:43,317 --> 00:01:45,962
要改变模型说的话，有三种办法
There are three ways to change what a model says.

30
00:01:46,282 --> 00:01:49,120
一个 prompt，在你每次提问时改变输入
A prompt changes the input every time you ask.

31
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:54,197
检索，也就是第 5 讲的 RAG 应用，把查到的文本加进输入
Retrieval, the RAG app from lecture 5, adds looked-up text to the input.

32
00:01:54,517 --> 00:01:56,778
这两种都不碰模型本身
Both leave the model itself untouched.

33
00:01:57,017 --> 00:02:00,807
微调转的是第三个旋钮：它改的是权重，办法是给模型看
Fine-tuning turns the third dial: it changes the weights,

34
00:02:00,807 --> 00:02:05,529
大量由一个输入和你想要的输出组成的例子
by showing the model many examples of an input and the output you want.

35
00:02:05,849 --> 00:02:09,510
在这门课里，通常指的是指令微调
In this course that usually means instruction fine-tuning:

36
00:02:09,510 --> 00:02:11,972
一条指令和它的回答，成对出现
pairs of an instruction and its answer.

37
00:02:12,292 --> 00:02:15,001
人设属于针对特定任务的微调
A persona is a task-specific fine-tune.

38
00:02:15,250 --> 00:02:18,194
对比一个从没做过指令微调的模型
Compare a model that was never instruction-tuned.

39
00:02:18,514 --> 00:02:21,923
这个 notebook 给 OPT 350m 的开头是
The notebook gives OPT 350m the words,

40
00:02:21,923 --> 00:02:24,167
“你好，我的奶酪名字是”
hello, my cheese name is.

41
00:02:24,487 --> 00:02:25,987
它就这么接着往下写
It simply keeps going:

42
00:02:25,987 --> 00:02:29,864
“我的奶酪名字叫奶酪，不知道你是不是在开玩笑”
my cheese name is cheese, I'm not sure if you're joking or not.

43
00:02:30,100 --> 00:02:33,671
经过指令微调的模型会回答，而不是续写
An instruction-tuned model answers instead of continuing,

44
00:02:33,671 --> 00:02:36,052
常常还带着一个习惯，比如 Sure, here's
often with a habit like, Sure, here's.

45
00:02:36,372 --> 00:02:39,785
我们微调后的 Qwen，会以授课老师的方式回答
Our fine-tuned Qwen answers the way the instructor would.

46
00:02:40,105 --> 00:02:45,290
这就是保存的那次运行给我们的一课：风格学得会；事实没有保证
That's the lesson of the saved run: style is learnable; facts are not guaranteed.

47
00:02:45,534 --> 00:02:50,230
一个好用的理解方式：微调动的是模型默认的口吻
A useful mental model: fine-tuning moves the model's default voice;

48
00:02:50,230 --> 00:02:52,894
RAG 换的是它桌上摊开的那本书
RAG changes the open book on its desk.

49
00:02:53,214 --> 00:02:56,990
路线 A 里，Google 训练模型，你一个权重都看不到
In track A, Google trains the model and you never see a weight.

50
00:02:57,310 --> 00:03:01,134
路线 B 里，你在 Colab 的 GPU 上训练一个小 adapter
In track B, you train a small adapter on a Colab GPU,

51
00:03:01,134 --> 00:03:02,899
存下来就是你的
and it is yours to save.

52
00:03:05,033 --> 00:03:08,075
从你的工作区开始，也就是 AC215 目录
Start in your workspace, the AC215 folder,

53
00:03:08,075 --> 00:03:10,537
Docker 要装好并且在运行
with Docker installed and running.

54
00:03:10,857 --> 00:03:15,486
README 只给了 repo 的链接，所以 clone 它算是额外的一步
The README only links the repository, so cloning it is an extra step.

55
00:03:15,806 --> 00:03:18,345
你的提示符显示的是你自己的用户名和机器名
Your prompt shows your own user name and machine.

56
00:03:18,583 --> 00:03:21,676
录制时用的是画面上的 commit；你的可能更新
Recorded at the commit on screen; yours may be newer.

57
00:03:21,996 --> 00:03:26,421
里面有两个目录，dataset-creator 和 gemini-finetuner
Inside are two folders, dataset-creator and gemini-finetuner,

58
00:03:26,421 --> 00:03:28,524
各有同样的六个文件
each with the same six files.

59
00:03:28,844 --> 00:03:32,983
这个 autotrain 目录不在 README 里，所以别动它
The autotrain folder is not part of the README, so leave it alone.

60
00:03:33,233 --> 00:03:35,580
第 2 步在云控制台里做
Step 2 happens in the cloud console.

61
00:03:35,900 --> 00:03:39,658
创建一个叫 llm-service-account 的服务账号
Create a service account called llm-service-account

62
00:03:39,658 --> 00:03:41,868
给它两个角色：Storage Admin
with two roles: Storage Admin,

63
00:03:41,868 --> 00:03:45,478
以及 Agent Platform User，以前叫 Vertex AI User
and Agent Platform User, formerly Vertex AI User.

64
00:03:45,798 --> 00:03:49,852
在密钥那一页添加一个 JSON 密钥，它会下载到你的笔记本上
Under keys, add a JSON key, which downloads to your laptop.

65
00:03:50,172 --> 00:03:53,308
如果你留着第 5 讲的那个账号，就直接复用
If you kept the account from lecture 5, reuse it.

66
00:03:53,550 --> 00:03:57,192
第 3 步：在 repo 旁边建一个叫 secrets 的目录
Step 3: make a folder called secrets next to the repository,

67
00:03:57,192 --> 00:03:58,792
不要建在 repo 里面
not inside it.

68
00:03:58,990 --> 00:04:04,629
把密钥移进去，名字必须正好是 llm-service-account.json
Move the key in and name it exactly llm-service-account.json;

69
00:04:04,629 --> 00:04:09,806
如果隐藏了文件扩展名，它可能会变成 .json.json
with hidden file extensions it can end up as .json.json.

70
00:04:10,126 --> 00:04:12,003
我们的故意留空
Ours stays empty on purpose.

71
00:04:12,323 --> 00:04:13,866
看看这会怎样
Watch what that does.

72
00:04:13,916 --> 00:04:15,751
为什么放在 repo 旁边？
Why next to the repository?

73
00:04:16,071 --> 00:04:19,655
放在 clone 外面的密钥，永远不会被不小心 commit 进去
A key outside the clone can never be committed by accident.

74
00:04:19,975 --> 00:04:24,417
这个 env.dev 文件从脚本运行的位置往上找两级目录
The env.dev file looks two folders up from wherever the script runs,

75
00:04:24,417 --> 00:04:27,356
所以两个 container 目录拿到的是同一个密钥
so both container folders reach the same key.

76
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:31,836
额外的第 4 步，是这个文件自己的注释暗示的
An extra step 4, implied by the file's own comments:

77
00:04:31,836 --> 00:04:37,456
在 env.dev 的第 6、7 行填上你自己的项目 ID 和 bucket 名称
in env.dev, set your own project ID and bucket name on lines 6 and 7.

78
00:04:37,776 --> 00:04:40,186
脚本会把这两项传进 container
The scripts pass both into the containers.

79
00:04:40,433 --> 00:04:45,389
README 还默认：Agent Platform 和 Storage 的 API 已经启用
The README also assumes the Agent Platform and Storage APIs are enabled,

80
00:04:45,389 --> 00:04:47,110
你也有一个自己的 bucket
and a bucket of your own.

81
00:04:47,430 --> 00:04:51,526
每个 bucket 的名称都是全局唯一的，cheese-dataset 是课程的
Bucket names are global, and cheese-dataset belongs to the course.

82
00:04:51,846 --> 00:04:54,001
在这里暂停，把四步都做完
Pause here and finish all four steps.

83
00:04:57,150 --> 00:05:01,886
数据集那一节的第 1 步：进入 dataset-creator 目录
Step 1 of the dataset section: go into the dataset-creator folder.

84
00:05:02,206 --> 00:05:04,937
第 2 步：sh docker-shell.sh
Step 2: sh docker-shell.sh.

85
00:05:05,257 --> 00:05:07,326
第一次构建会把所有东西装好
The first build installs everything.

86
00:05:07,646 --> 00:05:12,105
这里网速快，用了 45 秒；你那边可能要几分钟
Here it took 45 seconds on a fast connection; expect a few minutes.

87
00:05:12,425 --> 00:05:15,497
如果看到 source: not found，修法马上就讲
If you see source: not found, the fix is coming.

88
00:05:15,733 --> 00:05:17,333
这个脚本做了什么？
What did the script do?

89
00:05:17,397 --> 00:05:22,803
它读取 env.dev，构建 image，再挂载两个目录运行它
It reads env.dev, builds the image, and runs it with two folders mounted:

90
00:05:22,803 --> 00:05:27,765
这个目录变成 /app，你的 secrets 目录变成 /secrets
this folder becomes /app, and your secrets folder becomes /secrets.

91
00:05:28,085 --> 00:05:32,032
三个环境变量分别带着密钥的路径、你的项目和你的 bucket
Three variables carry the key's path, your project and your bucket.

92
00:05:32,352 --> 00:05:36,491
这个 --rm 参数会在你退出时删掉 container
The --rm flag removes the container when you exit.

93
00:05:36,733 --> 00:05:41,647
对横幅宽容一点：它在激活那一行运行之前就说已激活
Read the banner kindly: it says activated before the activation line runs,

94
00:05:41,647 --> 00:05:44,370
提示符也从来不显示 app 前缀
and the prompt never shows an app prefix.

95
00:05:44,690 --> 00:05:45,979
两个都无害
Both are harmless;

96
00:05:45,979 --> 00:05:49,272
额外检查一下，Python 来自 /.venv
an extra check shows Python comes from /.venv,

97
00:05:49,272 --> 00:05:51,133
你的设置也都传进来了
and your settings arrived.

98
00:05:51,453 --> 00:05:53,750
提示符里 app 和 @ 符号后面那一段
The part after app and the at sign

99
00:05:53,750 --> 00:05:55,117
就是 container ID
is the container ID;

100
00:05:55,117 --> 00:05:56,517
你的会不一样
yours will differ.

101
00:05:56,567 --> 00:05:58,986
第 3 步是 README 的提示
Step 3 is the README's tip:

102
00:05:58,986 --> 00:06:02,391
在 container 里运行 ls -la /secrets
ls -la /secrets, inside the container.

103
00:06:02,711 --> 00:06:06,892
有密钥的话，你会在这里看到 llm-service-account.json
With a key, you'd see llm-service-account.json here.

104
00:06:07,212 --> 00:06:10,199
我们的只显示目录本身，是故意的
Ours shows only the folder itself, on purpose.

105
00:06:10,433 --> 00:06:13,953
第 4 步：python cli.py --help
Step 4: python cli.py --help.

106
00:06:14,273 --> 00:06:17,238
三个参数：generate、prepare 和 upload
Three flags: generate, prepare and upload.

107
00:06:17,558 --> 00:06:22,806
没有密钥也能用，因为代码只在第一次调用 Google 时才去找凭据
It works without a key, because the code only looks for credentials when it first calls Google.

108
00:06:23,126 --> 00:06:24,876
暂停一下，走到这个提示符
Pause, and get to this prompt.

109
00:06:27,117 --> 00:06:30,189
两个坑，作为额外的演示，在第二个终端里跑
Two traps, shown as extras from a second terminal.

110
00:06:30,509 --> 00:06:33,937
在 Debian、Ubuntu 或 WSL 上，sh 就是 dash
On Debian, Ubuntu or WSL, sh is dash,

111
00:06:33,937 --> 00:06:39,682
它没有 source 命令：改用 bash docker-shell.sh
which has no source command: run bash docker-shell.sh instead.

112
00:06:40,002 --> 00:06:44,617
还有，在 repo 根目录下，脚本找不到 env.dev
And from the repository root, the script cannot find env.dev:

113
00:06:44,617 --> 00:06:46,509
先 cd 进这个目录
cd into the folder first.

114
00:06:47,933 --> 00:06:52,776
再来一个额外的：用 docker images 看，有 1.64 GB
One more extra: docker images reports 1.64 gigabytes.

115
00:06:53,096 --> 00:06:55,878
这个 lock 文件装了 133 个包
The lockfile installs 133 packages,

116
00:06:55,878 --> 00:07:00,012
其中有 RAG 那一讲的 chromadb 和 langchain
among them the RAG lecture's chromadb and langchain,

117
00:07:00,012 --> 00:07:02,397
而这份代码从来不导入它们
which this code never imports.

118
00:07:06,633 --> 00:07:10,833
课上讲的指令数据集，每个例子有三部分
The lecture's instruction dataset has three parts per example:

119
00:07:10,833 --> 00:07:14,761
一条指令、可选的上下文，以及你想要的输出
an instruction, optional context, and the output you want.

120
00:07:15,081 --> 00:07:20,052
教程去掉了上下文：每个例子就是一个问题加一个回答
The tutorial drops the context: each example is a question and an answer.

121
00:07:20,372 --> 00:07:21,972
一百组这样的例子，谁来写？
Who writes a hundred of them?

122
00:07:22,292 --> 00:07:23,998
另一个模型，也就是教师模型
Another model, a teacher.

123
00:07:24,233 --> 00:07:27,332
这里的教师模型是 Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite
Here the teacher is Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite,

124
00:07:27,332 --> 00:07:29,545
在 global 区域调用
called in the global location.

125
00:07:29,865 --> 00:07:33,538
它拿到一段描述人设的系统指令
It gets a system instruction describing the persona,

126
00:07:33,538 --> 00:07:36,081
一个要 20 组问答的输入 prompt
an input prompt asking for 20 pairs,

127
00:07:36,081 --> 00:07:39,472
还有一个规定回答形状的 JSON schema
and a JSON schema that fixes the answer's shape:

128
00:07:39,472 --> 00:07:41,449
question 和 answer 两个字段
question and answer objects.

129
00:07:42,583 --> 00:07:46,466
第 1 步：python cli.py --generate
Step 1: python cli.py --generate.

130
00:07:46,786 --> 00:07:52,332
有密钥的话，只花几美分：README 估计每 1000 次迭代 2 美元
With a key, it costs cents: the README estimates $2 per 1,000 iterations.

131
00:07:52,652 --> 00:07:57,111
没有密钥的话，每一批都打印同一行：密钥文件找不到
Without one, every batch prints the same line: the key file was not found.

132
00:07:57,431 --> 00:08:00,716
可退出码却是 0，也就是成功
And yet the exit status is zero, which means success.

133
00:08:01,036 --> 00:08:02,516
记住这个 0
Remember that zero.

134
00:08:02,566 --> 00:08:07,323
第 2 步讲的是 system prompt，它就写在 cli.py 里
Step 2 explains the system prompt, which lives in cli.py.

135
00:08:07,643 --> 00:08:12,796
它要教师模型在每个回答开头用一句授课老师的口头禅
It tells the teacher to open each answer with one of the instructor's catchphrases,

136
00:08:12,796 --> 00:08:15,217
比如 good question，或者 glad you ask
such as good question, or glad you ask.

137
00:08:15,537 --> 00:08:20,166
它还要求加入热情的感叹语，突出授课老师的个性
And it asks for enthusiastic exclamations, in the instructor's character.

138
00:08:20,416 --> 00:08:24,512
第 3 步是输入 prompt，要 20 组各不相同的问答
Step 3 is the input prompt, asking for 20 diverse pairs.

139
00:08:24,832 --> 00:08:30,421
第 4 步：迭代次数是第 170 行的一个常量，不是参数
Step 4: the number of iterations is a constant on line 170, not a flag;

140
00:08:30,421 --> 00:08:32,704
想要更大的数据集，就改它
edit it for a bigger dataset.

141
00:08:33,024 --> 00:08:35,351
把 temperature 设成 0.9 是为了增加多样性
Temperature 0.9 adds variety,

142
00:08:35,351 --> 00:08:40,406
这个 response schema 让 Gemini 按那个形状返回 JSON
and the response schema makes Gemini return JSON in that shape.

143
00:08:40,650 --> 00:08:44,877
有密钥的话，这些文件里会是 README 样例那样的回答
With a key, the files would hold answers like the README's samples:

144
00:08:44,877 --> 00:08:48,031
“Yello，我是授课老师，你的 cheese monker”
Yello, this is the instructor, your cheese monker.

145
00:08:48,351 --> 00:08:49,448
一个小疏漏
A small slip:

146
00:08:49,448 --> 00:08:54,510
README 摘录的 prompt 里列出的开场白比 cli.py 的旧
the README's prompt excerpt lists older openers than cli.py,

147
00:08:54,510 --> 00:08:59,487
但 cli.py 自己的样例还是以 Yello 和 Welcome 开头
but cli.py's own samples still open with Yello and Welcome.

148
00:08:59,807 --> 00:09:01,166
你会看到两样混着出现
Expect a mix.

149
00:09:01,216 --> 00:09:03,371
继续之前，先想一个问题
One question before we move on.

150
00:09:03,691 --> 00:09:08,384
这个 prompt 要教师模型给出具体细节，比如最适 pH 值
The prompt asks the teacher for specifics, such as optimal pH levels.

151
00:09:17,233 --> 00:09:18,982
它会变成训练目标
It becomes a training target.

152
00:09:19,302 --> 00:09:23,420
学生模型学着把它说出来，说得很自信，用的是授课老师的口吻
The student learns to say it, confidently, in the instructor's voice.

153
00:09:23,740 --> 00:09:28,390
合成数据会带上教师模型的错误，所以要检查教师模型写了什么
Synthetic data carries the teacher's mistakes, so check what the teacher wrote.

154
00:09:29,732 --> 00:09:31,758
现在到 prepare 那一节的第 1 步
Now step 1 of the prepare section,

155
00:09:31,758 --> 00:09:34,617
学生跑完刚才那条，接着就会敲它
as a student would type it right after that run.

156
00:09:34,937 --> 00:09:38,116
输入这条命令：python cli.py --prepare
Type python cli.py --prepare.

157
00:09:38,436 --> 00:09:42,105
0 个错误，形状是 0 乘 0，然后崩溃
Zero errors, a shape of zero by zero, and then a crash.

158
00:09:42,425 --> 00:09:47,247
在 cli.py 第 243 行报 KeyError: 'question'
KeyError: 'question', from line 243 of cli.py.

159
00:09:47,482 --> 00:09:48,861
往回追
Trace it back.

160
00:09:48,911 --> 00:09:52,363
在 generate 里，每一批都在一个 try 块里运行
In generate, each batch runs inside a try block,

161
00:09:52,363 --> 00:09:57,829
第 200 行的 except 会捕获任何异常，打印出来，然后继续
and the except on line 200 catches any exception, prints it, and carries on.

162
00:09:58,149 --> 00:10:02,031
所以一个文件都没写出来，这条命令却还是以 0 退出
So no file was written, and the command still exited with zero.

163
00:10:02,265 --> 00:10:05,135
这次 prepare 没找到文件，就建了一张空表
Prepare found no files, built an empty table,

164
00:10:05,135 --> 00:10:09,567
第一次读 question 列就失败了。错误一直都在
and failed the first time it read the question column. The error

165
00:10:09,567 --> 00:10:13,422
那个全捕获的 except 只是把它推迟到了下一条命令
was there all along; the catch-all only moved it one command later.

166
00:10:13,742 --> 00:10:16,004
看输出的内容，别只看退出码
Read the lines, not the exit code.

167
00:10:16,249 --> 00:10:20,526
修法就是密钥本身：把它放进 secrets 目录
The fix is the key itself: put it in the secrets folder

168
00:10:20,526 --> 00:10:24,569
名字要完全一致，再用这条命令检查：ls -la /secrets
with the exact name, and check with ls -la /secrets.

169
00:10:24,815 --> 00:10:27,488
为了看一次真实的运行，额外加一步
So we can watch a real run, an extra:

170
00:10:27,488 --> 00:10:30,450
五个手写的文件，标着 scripted
five hand-written files, tagged scripted,

171
00:10:30,450 --> 00:10:33,050
形状和 Gemini 返回的完全一样
in exactly the shape Gemini returns.

172
00:10:33,370 --> 00:10:37,346
里面一共 20 组，Gemini 会写一百组左右
They hold 20 pairs, where Gemini would write about a hundred;

173
00:10:37,346 --> 00:10:39,236
你的 generate 会写出它自己的
your generate writes its own.

174
00:10:39,556 --> 00:10:43,077
注意失败的那次运行留下的 1 字节 CSV
Note the 1-byte CSV the failed run left behind.

175
00:10:43,315 --> 00:10:44,865
现在再跑一次 prepare
Now prepare again.

176
00:10:44,915 --> 00:10:49,416
处理了五个文件，0 个错误，形状是 19 乘 2
Five files processed, zero errors, and a shape of 19 by 2.

177
00:10:49,736 --> 00:10:53,534
最后一组脚本数据故意重复了第一个问题
The last scripted pair repeats the first question on purpose.

178
00:10:53,854 --> 00:10:57,502
第 233 行的 drop duplicates 把它去掉了
drop_duplicates on line 233 removed it.

179
00:10:57,822 --> 00:11:00,041
每个回答都以一句口头禅开头
Every answer opens with a catchphrase.

180
00:11:00,282 --> 00:11:03,561
这些行保存成 instruct-dataset.csv
The rows are saved as instruct-dataset.csv:

181
00:11:03,561 --> 00:11:06,383
文件名里用的就是课上的术语
the lecture's term, in the file name.

182
00:11:06,703 --> 00:11:09,498
暂停一下，自己跑一遍 generate 和 prepare
Pause, and run generate and prepare yourself.

183
00:11:12,832 --> 00:11:15,454
接下来是 prepare 那一节的第 2 步，讲的是格式
Step 2 of prepare is about format.

184
00:11:15,504 --> 00:11:16,963
跟着一组问答走一遍
Follow one pair.

185
00:11:17,013 --> 00:11:18,912
它一开始是 CSV 里的一行
It starts as a CSV row.

186
00:11:19,232 --> 00:11:25,214
第 241 到 247 行把它拼成一段文本，加上 human 和 bot 标记
Lines 241 to 247 glue it into one text with human and bot labels,

187
00:11:25,214 --> 00:11:30,368
也就是 repo 里 autotrain 目录读的那个 text 列
the text column the repository's autotrain folder reads.

188
00:11:30,688 --> 00:11:32,373
路线 A 用不到它
Track A doesn't use that one.

189
00:11:32,615 --> 00:11:37,062
第 251 到 257 行构造出 Gemini 微调要的格式
Lines 251 to 257 build what Gemini tuning expects:

190
00:11:37,062 --> 00:11:42,220
一个叫 contents 的列表，里面有 user 这一轮和 model 这一轮
a list called contents, with a user turn and a model turn,

191
00:11:42,220 --> 00:11:44,711
每一轮都带着 parts 和 text
each holding parts and text.

192
00:11:44,949 --> 00:11:47,850
额外看一眼真正的 train.jsonl
An extra look at the real train.jsonl:

193
00:11:47,850 --> 00:11:53,653
嵌套方式和 README 的例子一样，只是每个样本只占一行
the same nesting as the README's example, but each example on a single line.

194
00:11:53,973 --> 00:11:57,130
这就是 JSONL 里的 L：JSON lines
That's the L in JSONL: JSON lines.

195
00:11:57,365 --> 00:12:02,784
然后 train test split 用固定的随机种子留出 10%
Then train_test_split holds out 10 percent with a fixed seed:

196
00:12:02,784 --> 00:12:08,559
17 个样本放进 train.jsonl，2 个放进 test.jsonl
17 examples in train.jsonl, 2 in test.jsonl, which the tuning job

197
00:12:08,559 --> 00:12:10,336
微调任务拿它们做验证
uses for validation.

198
00:12:10,656 --> 00:12:15,897
代码注释说 Gemini 最多接受 256 个验证样本
The code's comment says Gemini accepts at most 256 validation examples,

199
00:12:15,897 --> 00:12:17,497
所以才有这个上限
hence the cap.

200
00:12:21,099 --> 00:12:24,940
不管外面怎么包装，训练的仍然是预测下一个词
Whatever the wrapping, training is still next-word prediction,

201
00:12:24,940 --> 00:12:26,923
只不过现在预测的是授课老师的回答
now on the instructor's answers.

202
00:12:28,599 --> 00:12:30,409
额外从笔记本这边看一眼
An extra from the laptop side:

203
00:12:30,409 --> 00:12:33,186
这个 bind mount 把这些文件留在了你的 clone 里
the bind mount left these files in your clone.

204
00:12:33,506 --> 00:12:36,210
用 git status 看，data 目录是被忽略的
git status shows the data folder as ignored,

205
00:12:36,210 --> 00:12:38,177
所以它不会进到你的 commit 里
so it stays out of your commits.

206
00:12:38,415 --> 00:12:43,236
下一节是 upload：python cli.py --upload
Next section, upload: python cli.py --upload.

207
00:12:43,556 --> 00:12:45,273
这次它失败得很明显
This time it fails loudly,

208
00:12:45,273 --> 00:12:48,378
报的是 DefaultCredentialsError：文件找不到
with a DefaultCredentialsError: file not found.

209
00:12:48,698 --> 00:12:51,215
有密钥的话，README 也没写会输出什么
With a key, no output is documented.

210
00:12:51,535 --> 00:12:54,938
要找的是每个文件一行、以 Uploading file 开头的输出
Look for one line per file starting with Uploading file,

211
00:12:54,938 --> 00:12:57,551
一共五行，然后去你的 bucket 里找到它们
five in all, then find them in your bucket.

212
00:12:57,799 --> 00:13:01,567
一个小疏漏：README 从没说要建这个 bucket
A small slip: the README never says to create that bucket,

213
00:13:01,567 --> 00:13:03,452
而 upload 默认它已经存在
and upload assumes it exists.

214
00:13:03,772 --> 00:13:05,194
先把它建好
Make it first.

215
00:13:05,244 --> 00:13:08,722
如果你刚改过 env.dev，就重启 container
If you just changed env.dev, restart the container.

216
00:13:09,042 --> 00:13:10,642
然后暂停，上传
Then pause and upload.

217
00:13:13,882 --> 00:13:15,610
接下来是微调那一节
On to the fine-tune section.

218
00:13:15,930 --> 00:13:18,841
输入 exit，container 会自己删掉
Type exit; the container removes itself,

219
00:13:18,841 --> 00:13:22,117
额外跑一个 docker ps -a，什么都没剩下
and an extra docker ps -a shows nothing left.

220
00:13:22,437 --> 00:13:25,487
第 1 步：进入 gemini-finetuner 目录
Step 1: go to the gemini-finetuner folder.

221
00:13:26,132 --> 00:13:28,550
README 漏掉了一个额外的修改
An extra edit the README leaves out:

222
00:13:28,550 --> 00:13:32,916
第 10、11 行还指向课程的 bucket，cheese-dataset
lines 10 and 11 still point at the course bucket, cheese-dataset.

223
00:13:33,236 --> 00:13:36,806
只把 cheese-dataset 换成你的 bucket 名
Replace only cheese-dataset with your bucket name;

224
00:13:36,806 --> 00:13:39,948
目录 llm-finetune-dataset-small 保留不动
keep the folder, llm-finetune-dataset-small,

225
00:13:39,948 --> 00:13:41,876
upload 就把文件放在那里
where upload put the files.

226
00:13:42,196 --> 00:13:46,356
这个目录挂载进了 container，所以不用重新构建
The folder is mounted into the container, so there's no need to rebuild.

227
00:13:46,599 --> 00:13:49,778
第 2 步：再跑一次 sh docker-shell.sh
Step 2: sh docker-shell.sh again.

228
00:13:50,098 --> 00:13:53,616
一下就好了：uv sync 之前的每一层都有缓存
It's instant: every layer up to uv sync is cached,

229
00:13:53,616 --> 00:13:58,612
因为两个目录共用同一个 Dockerfile、pyproject 和 lock 文件
because both folders share the same Dockerfile, pyproject and lockfile,

230
00:13:58,612 --> 00:14:00,231
额外跑一个 diff 就能看到
as an extra diff shows.

231
00:14:01,465 --> 00:14:02,465
第 3 步
Step 3:

232
00:14:02,465 --> 00:14:07,161
python cli.py --help 显示两个参数，train 和 chat
python cli.py --help shows two flags, train and chat.

233
00:14:07,481 --> 00:14:11,342
负责训练的客户端在 us-central1 创建微调任务
The train client creates tuning jobs in us-central1.

234
00:14:11,662 --> 00:14:16,328
负责聊天的客户端调用多区域 us 里的微调后的模型
The chat client calls the tuned model in the multi-region location us,

235
00:14:16,328 --> 00:14:17,928
用的是它自己的地址
at its own address.

236
00:14:18,065 --> 00:14:22,185
这个 train 函数把你 bucket 里的文件包装成微调数据集
The train function wraps your bucket files as tuning datasets,

237
00:14:22,185 --> 00:14:25,574
要求跑一个 epoch，adapter 大小为 4
and asks for one epoch and an adapter of size four.

238
00:14:25,894 --> 00:14:29,578
按我们的理解，这就是那个思路的 Google 托管版本
By our reading, that's Google's managed version of the idea

239
00:14:29,578 --> 00:14:31,178
你会在第二部分亲手搭建
you'll build in part 2.

240
00:14:31,398 --> 00:14:33,020
一次调用就启动了这个任务
One call starts the job.

241
00:14:33,265 --> 00:14:39,025
微调模型那一节的第 1 步：python cli.py --train
Step 1 of the fine-tune model section: python cli.py --train.

242
00:14:39,345 --> 00:14:41,649
实验性警告没有关系
The experimental warning is harmless.

243
00:14:41,969 --> 00:14:44,764
然后是缺少密钥：没有创建任务
Then the missing key: no job was created.

244
00:14:44,999 --> 00:14:48,009
有密钥的话，要找的是 Training job started
With a key, look for Training job started,

245
00:14:48,009 --> 00:14:49,873
一个在 us-central1 的任务名
a job name in us-central1,

246
00:14:49,873 --> 00:14:52,956
一分钟后还有 Tuned model info: None
and after a minute, Tuned model info: None.

247
00:14:53,276 --> 00:14:56,181
这里 main 调用 train 时把 wait for job 设为 false
Main calls train with wait_for_job=False,

248
00:14:56,181 --> 00:15:01,554
所以这条命令交了任务就走，就像在干洗店拿一张取衣单
so the command hands in the job and leaves, like a ticket at the dry cleaner.

249
00:15:01,874 --> 00:15:06,012
暂停之前，先看价格表，不到一分钟就会出现
Before you pause, watch the cost table, coming up in under a minute;

250
00:15:06,012 --> 00:15:08,081
然后再回来启动你的任务
then come back and start your job.

251
00:15:10,315 --> 00:15:13,914
训练需要的显存比笔记本多得多
Training needs far more GPU memory than a laptop has;

252
00:15:13,914 --> 00:15:15,883
在这里，那是 Google 要操心的事
here that's Google's problem.

253
00:15:16,203 --> 00:15:20,229
第 2 步：在控制台里盯着这个任务，直到它显示 succeeded
Step 2: watch the job in the console until it says succeeded,

254
00:15:20,229 --> 00:15:22,539
并且有了微调后的模型和一个 endpoint
with a tuned model and an endpoint.

255
00:15:22,782 --> 00:15:24,382
暂停一下，想一个问题
A question to pause on.

256
00:15:33,182 --> 00:15:37,619
在 Google 位于 us-central1 的硬件上，直接读取你的 bucket
On Google's hardware in us-central1, reading your bucket directly.

257
00:15:37,939 --> 00:15:41,993
删掉 container 不会丢任何东西：它只是提交了任务
Deleting the container loses nothing: it only submitted the job.

258
00:15:43,932 --> 00:15:46,855
费用那一节的第 1 步：README 里的价格表
Step 1 of the cost section: the README's table.

259
00:15:47,175 --> 00:15:50,953
按每千个 token 0.008 美元算
At $0.008 per thousand tokens,

260
00:15:50,953 --> 00:15:55,362
16444 个文档跑 3 个 epoch
16,444 documents over 3 epochs come

261
00:15:55,362 --> 00:15:58,763
一共 112.73 美元
to $112.73; the table calls

262
00:15:58,763 --> 00:16:01,660
表里说这数据太多了
that way too much data.

263
00:16:01,980 --> 00:16:05,052
88 个文档大约 57 美分
88 documents cost about 57 cents.

264
00:16:05,299 --> 00:16:10,658
一个小疏漏：这张表算的是 Gemini 1.5 Flash 跑 3 个 epoch
A small slip: the table prices Gemini 1.5 Flash for 3 epochs,

265
00:16:10,658 --> 00:16:14,963
而代码微调的是 Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite，跑 1 个
while the code tunes Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite for 1.

266
00:16:15,283 --> 00:16:19,613
这些数字就当是过时的，去看 README 链接的价格页面
Treat these numbers as stale and check the pricing page the README links.

267
00:16:19,849 --> 00:16:22,281
聊天之前，还有一个额外的修改
Before you chat, one more extra edit.

268
00:16:22,601 --> 00:16:26,420
第 107 行写的还是授课老师的 endpoint
Line 107 still holds the instructor's endpoint.

269
00:16:26,740 --> 00:16:29,022
从控制台复制你自己的
Copy yours from the console:

270
00:16:29,022 --> 00:16:33,097
一个以 locations、us、endpoints 和一个 ID 结尾的路径
a path ending in locations/us/endpoints and an ID.

271
00:16:33,417 --> 00:16:34,417
把它贴到那里
Paste it there;

272
00:16:34,417 --> 00:16:38,793
否则 chat 会指向授课老师的 endpoint，你的密钥访问不了
otherwise chat points at the instructor's endpoint, which your key can't reach.

273
00:16:39,032 --> 00:16:42,595
第 2 步：python cli.py --chat
Step 2: python cli.py --chat.

274
00:16:42,915 --> 00:16:44,304
它会打印它的问题
It prints its question,

275
00:16:44,304 --> 00:16:47,928
“希腊的奶酪是怎么做的，用授课老师的方式回答”
how is cheese made in Greece, answered the instructor's way.

276
00:16:48,248 --> 00:16:52,493
然后打印部署区域 us，还有同样的缺少密钥
Then it prints the serving location, us, and the same missing key.

277
00:16:52,813 --> 00:16:55,331
暂停一下，填好你的 endpoint 之后跑一遍
Pause and run it once your endpoint is in.

278
00:16:57,565 --> 00:17:01,807
README 展示了一个能用的 endpoint 对一个旧问题的回答
The README shows a working endpoint's answer to an older question:

279
00:17:01,807 --> 00:17:03,407
开场白同样是 Yello
the same Yello opener.

280
00:17:03,624 --> 00:17:05,224
你的回答会不一样
Your answer will differ.

281
00:17:05,315 --> 00:17:08,700
第 3 步是托管的演示，可选。第 4 步
Step 3, the hosted demo, is optional. Step 4:

282
00:17:08,700 --> 00:17:14,382
控制台的训练监控会显示你这次任务的 loss 曲线和数据分布
the console's training monitor shows your job's loss curves and its data distribution.

283
00:17:14,632 --> 00:17:18,328
这就是路线 A：教师模型写数据，Google 跑任务
That's track A: a teacher wrote the data, Google ran the job,

284
00:17:18,328 --> 00:17:20,328
你有一个 endpoint 可以调用
and you have an endpoint to call.

285
00:17:20,648 --> 00:17:22,547
而你一个权重都没见过
And you never saw a single weight.

286
00:17:22,867 --> 00:17:25,235
第二部分，权重就在你自己手里了
In part 2, the weights are in your hands.

287
00:17:27,282 --> 00:17:29,774
第二部分在课程的 Colab 里做
Part 2 happens in the course Colab,

288
00:17:29,774 --> 00:17:32,125
Tutorial - Finetuning with QLoRA
Tutorial - Finetuning with QLoRA.

289
00:17:32,445 --> 00:17:36,135
从这一讲的 Ed 课程页面打开它，链接就在屏幕上
Open it from the lecture's Ed lesson; the link is on screen.

290
00:17:36,455 --> 00:17:40,594
先点 File，再点 Save a copy in Drive；原版是只读的
First: File, Save a copy in Drive; the original is view-only.

291
00:17:40,914 --> 00:17:44,754
然后点 Runtime，再点 Change runtime type，选一个 GPU
Then: Runtime, Change runtime type, and pick a GPU.

292
00:17:45,074 --> 00:17:46,695
免费的 T4 就够了
A free T4 is enough.

293
00:17:48,432 --> 00:17:52,181
第 3 节 pin 住 transformers、bitsandbytes 和 trl
Section 3 pins transformers, bitsandbytes and trl,

294
00:17:52,181 --> 00:17:55,705
并卸载 torchao，notebook 里说
and removes torchao, which, the notebook notes,

295
00:17:55,705 --> 00:17:58,480
有它在的话 peft 不肯添加 LoRA 层
makes peft refuse to add LoRA layers.

296
00:17:58,715 --> 00:18:02,200
第 4 节需要一个免费的 Hugging Face token
Section 4 needs a free Hugging Face token:

297
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:04,938
在 Hugging Face 网站上打开 Settings
on huggingface.co, open Settings,

298
00:18:04,938 --> 00:18:08,092
再点 Access Tokens，建一个只读的 token
then Access Tokens, make a read token,

299
00:18:08,092 --> 00:18:11,494
存进 Colab 的 Secrets，命名为 HF token
and save it in Colab secrets as HF_TOKEN.

300
00:18:11,814 --> 00:18:16,064
第 5 节导入这些库，打印版本
Section 5 imports the libraries, prints the versions,

301
00:18:16,064 --> 00:18:20,715
录制时是 torch 2.11 和 transformers 5.16
at the time of recording torch 2.11 and transformers 5.16,

302
00:18:20,715 --> 00:18:22,480
然后挂载你的 Drive
and mounts your Drive.

303
00:18:22,800 --> 00:18:25,318
第 6 节把两个模型都缓存到那里
Section 6 caches both models there.

304
00:18:25,638 --> 00:18:27,238
暂停一下，跑完 Part A
Pause and run part A.

305
00:18:29,415 --> 00:18:31,036
现在来看课上的问题
Now the lecture's question.

306
00:18:31,356 --> 00:18:33,319
为什么不干脆训练所有权重？
Why not simply train all the weights?

307
00:18:33,639 --> 00:18:37,653
拿一个 100 亿参数、用 16 位浮点数存的模型来说
Take a model with 10 billion parameters in 16-bit floats:

308
00:18:37,653 --> 00:18:40,189
光是权重就要 20 GB
the weights alone take 20 gigabytes.

309
00:18:49,032 --> 00:18:52,595
梯度每个权重一个，又要 20 GB
The gradients, one per weight, take another 20 gigabytes.

310
00:18:52,915 --> 00:18:57,233
Adam 优化器还要给每个权重保留两个滑动平均
And the Adam optimizer keeps two running averages per weight

311
00:18:57,233 --> 00:18:59,464
用 32 位浮点数存：80 GB
in 32-bit floats: 80 gigabytes.

312
00:18:59,784 --> 00:19:07,677
一共 120 GB，相当于五块 24 GB GPU 的显存，这还没算激活值
That's 120 in total, the memory of five GPUs with 24 gigabytes each, before any activations.

313
00:19:07,915 --> 00:19:13,509
LoRA 只训练小小的 adapter，所以梯度和优化器状态几乎没了
LoRA trains only small adapters, so gradients and optimizer states nearly vanish,

314
00:19:13,509 --> 00:19:17,792
但冻结的基座还得待在显存里做前向传播
but the frozen base still sits in memory for the forward pass.

315
00:19:18,112 --> 00:19:20,843
课上估计这部分大约 40 GB
The lecture puts that at about 40 gigabytes.

316
00:19:21,163 --> 00:19:26,475
QLoRA 把基座用 4 位存储，课上算出的总量降到大约 12 GB
QLoRA stores the base in 4 bits, and the lecture's total drops to about 12.

317
00:19:26,795 --> 00:19:28,950
接下来几章讲的就是这三根柱子
The next chapters are those three bars.

318
00:19:30,982 --> 00:19:34,214
量化就是把一个区间分成若干个桶
Quantization means splitting a range into buckets

319
00:19:34,214 --> 00:19:37,446
只记下每个数落进了哪个桶
and storing only which bucket a number fell into.

320
00:19:37,766 --> 00:19:42,566
课上先讲 LoRA；我们跟着 notebook 走，它先做量化
The lecture builds LoRA first; we follow the notebook, which quantizes first.

321
00:19:42,815 --> 00:19:51,391
把 27、55.3 和 83.78 取整：27、55 和 84
Round 27, 55.3 and 83.78 to whole numbers: 27, 55 and 84.

322
00:19:51,711 --> 00:19:54,463
取整到十位：30、60 和 80
Round to tens: 30, 60 and 80.

323
00:19:54,783 --> 00:19:58,047
桶越少，需要的位数越少，丢掉的细节也越多
Fewer buckets need fewer bits, and lose more detail.

324
00:19:58,282 --> 00:20:01,119
课上的例题用的是 absmax
The lecture's worked example uses absmax.

325
00:20:01,439 --> 00:20:09,643
从 1.5 到 10.2 的十个数，都乘以 127 除以最大值
Ten values from 1.5 to 10.2 are multiplied by 127 over the largest,

326
00:20:09,643 --> 00:20:13,194
所以 10.2 正好落在 127 上
so 10.2 lands exactly on 127.

327
00:20:13,514 --> 00:20:21,151
然后每个数取整：1.5 变成 19，5.6 变成 70
Then each value rounds to an integer: 1.5 becomes 19, and 5.6 becomes 70.

328
00:20:21,399 --> 00:20:27,820
再除回去，19 变成 1.526，70 变成 5.622
Divide back, and 19 becomes 1.526, 70 becomes 5.622.

329
00:20:28,140 --> 00:20:33,751
那些红色的小缺口就是反量化误差：量化总会丢一点东西
Those small red gaps are the dequantization error: quantization always loses a little.

330
00:20:34,071 --> 00:20:38,871
课件上写的是 18 和 69；四舍五入应该是 19 和 70
The slide shows 18 and 69; rounding gives 19 and 70.

331
00:20:39,115 --> 00:20:41,964
整个矩阵只用一个常数有风险
One constant for a whole matrix is risky:

332
00:20:41,964 --> 00:20:45,579
一个很大的权重会挤掉其他所有权重的精度
one large weight squashes everyone else's precision.

333
00:20:45,899 --> 00:20:51,105
所以 bitsandbytes 给每块 64 个权重单独存一个 absmax 常数
So bitsandbytes keeps one absmax constant per small block of 64 weights.

334
00:20:51,349 --> 00:20:53,269
4 位能表示 16 个级别
Four bits give 16 levels.

335
00:20:53,589 --> 00:20:57,992
权重呈钟形分布，所以 4 位 NormalFloat，也就是 NF4
Weights are bell-shaped, so 4-bit NormalFloat, NF4, puts them

336
00:20:57,992 --> 00:21:01,674
把级别放在分位数上：零附近密，两端稀
at quantiles: dense near zero, sparse in the tails.

337
00:21:01,994 --> 00:21:06,325
每个权重存成一个 4 位的索引；两个正好装进一个字节
Each weight is stored as a 4-bit index; two of them fit in one byte.

338
00:21:06,565 --> 00:21:11,450
这些每块的常数加起来也不少，所以双重量化把它们也量化了
Those block constants add up, so double quantization quantizes them as well.

339
00:21:11,770 --> 00:21:16,443
课上跳过了它；notebook 把它打开了，就在这里，NF4 旁边
The lecture skips it; the notebook turns it on, right here, beside NF4.

340
00:21:16,682 --> 00:21:21,375
用 4 位存，用 16 位算：每次做矩阵乘法
Stored in 4 bits, computed in 16: for each matrix multiply,

341
00:21:21,375 --> 00:21:26,943
这一层的权重都会展开成一份 16 位的副本，用完就丢
the layer's weights are expanded to a 16-bit copy, used, then dropped.

342
00:21:27,263 --> 00:21:29,672
课上用 BF16 计算
The lecture computes in BF16;

343
00:21:29,672 --> 00:21:34,325
这个 notebook 用 FP16，训练那一章会解释原因
this notebook in FP16, as the training chapter explains.

344
00:21:34,565 --> 00:21:37,846
Part B 的第 1 节把小的 OPT 模型打印出来
Section 1 of part B prints the small OPT model:

345
00:21:37,846 --> 00:21:40,429
每个线性层现在都是 Linear4bit
every linear layer is now Linear4bit,

346
00:21:40,429 --> 00:21:44,549
而 embedding 和输出头保持原样
while the embeddings and the output head stay as they were.

347
00:21:44,869 --> 00:21:47,935
第 1 节还把一句话分词
Section 1 also tokenizes a short prompt,

348
00:21:47,935 --> 00:21:52,229
第 2 节生成我们前面见过的那段续写
and section 2 generates the continuation we met earlier.

349
00:21:52,549 --> 00:21:54,256
暂停一下，跑完 Part B
Pause, and run part B.

350
00:21:56,499 --> 00:22:01,654
有两个误解要丢掉：4 位模型并不做 4 位运算
Two misconceptions to drop: a 4-bit model does not do 4-bit arithmetic,

351
00:22:01,654 --> 00:22:04,051
省下来的是显存，不是速度
and the win is memory, not speed.

352
00:22:06,098 --> 00:22:09,693
Part C 的第 1 步加载真正的学生模型
Part C, step 1, loads the real student,

353
00:22:09,693 --> 00:22:13,287
Qwen3 0.6B，用的是同样的 4 位配方
Qwen3 0.6B, with the same 4-bit recipe.

354
00:22:13,607 --> 00:22:17,229
接着 prepare model for k-bit training 冻结所有权重
Then prepare_model_for_kbit_training freezes every weight

355
00:22:17,229 --> 00:22:22,247
并打开梯度检查点，这是一个省显存的技巧，训练那一章会讲
and turns on gradient checkpointing, a memory trick the training chapter shows.

356
00:22:22,481 --> 00:22:28,305
第 2.1 节数参数：3.758 亿
Section 2.1 counts the parameters: 375.8 million.

357
00:22:28,625 --> 00:22:33,297
可 Qwen3 0.6B 有 5.96 亿
But Qwen3 0.6B has 596 million.

358
00:22:42,131 --> 00:22:45,347
线性层里的 4.4 亿个权重
The 440 million weights in linear layers

359
00:22:45,347 --> 00:22:50,814
每两个 4 位的值打包进一个字节，所以只算 2.2 亿
are packed two 4-bit values to a byte, so they count as 220 million.

360
00:22:51,134 --> 00:22:57,064
1.556 亿个 embedding 权重和归一化层都没有量化
The 155.6 million embedding weights and the norms are not quantized.

361
00:22:57,384 --> 00:23:00,883
加起来：3.758 亿
Add them up: 375.8 million.

362
00:23:01,203 --> 00:23:04,958
配置在 2.2 里，确认用的是 NF4
The configuration, in 2.2, confirms NF4.

363
00:23:05,198 --> 00:23:09,934
在 2.3 里，基座模型续写一句话，写着写着就跑题了
In 2.3 the base model continues a sentence, and it drifts off topic.

364
00:23:10,254 --> 00:23:13,710
然后 2.4 数可训练参数：0 个
And 2.4 counts trainable parameters: zero.

365
00:23:14,030 --> 00:23:15,630
全都冻结了
Everything is frozen.

366
00:23:16,481 --> 00:23:18,977
这个 notebook 的第 3 步准备数据
The notebook's step 3 prepares the data.

367
00:23:19,297 --> 00:23:23,884
它下载一个 23 MB 的文件，从中抽取 1000 组问答
It downloads a 23 megabyte file and samples 1,000 pairs.

368
00:23:24,204 --> 00:23:27,830
看一行：contents，user 这一轮，model 这一轮
Look at a row: contents, a user turn, a model turn.

369
00:23:28,150 --> 00:23:32,524
这和路线 A 的格式一模一样：第一部分的那块砖，到了这里
It's exactly the format of track A: the brick from part 1 arrives here.

370
00:23:32,765 --> 00:23:37,200
第 3.5 节让 tokenizer 写出 Qwen 的聊天模板
Section 3.5 lets the tokenizer write Qwen's chat template:

371
00:23:37,200 --> 00:23:42,246
im start user，问题，im end，im start assistant
<|im_start|>user, the question, <|im_end|>, <|im_start|>assistant,

372
00:23:42,246 --> 00:23:45,074
一个空的 think 块，然后是回答
an empty think block, and the answer.

373
00:23:45,394 --> 00:23:49,514
空的 think 块就是 Qwen3 不思考、直接回答的方式
The empty think block is how Qwen3 answers without thinking,

374
00:23:49,514 --> 00:23:51,986
之后聊天也用同样的前缀
and chat uses the same prefix later.

375
00:23:52,231 --> 00:24:00,466
第 3.6 节分出 900 个训练、100 个测试，3.7 检查一个样本
Section 3.6 splits 900 for training and 100 for testing, and 3.7 checks one example.

376
00:24:00,786 --> 00:24:02,855
然后这条带子变成整数
Then the ribbon becomes integers,

377
00:24:02,855 --> 00:24:06,866
这个 loss 覆盖每一个 token，连问题和模板也算在内
and the loss covers every token, question and template included.

378
00:24:07,186 --> 00:24:09,042
说到底还是预测下一个词
It's still next-word prediction.

379
00:24:09,362 --> 00:24:11,495
暂停一下，把第 1 到第 3 步跑一遍
Pause, and run steps 1 to 3.

380
00:24:14,832 --> 00:24:19,355
参数高效微调只训练一小部分，其余的冻结
Parameter-efficient fine-tuning trains a small part and freezes the rest.

381
00:24:19,675 --> 00:24:26,096
课上把这些方法分成三大类：加性、选择性和重参数化
The lecture sorts the methods into three families: additive, selective and reparameterization.

382
00:24:26,416 --> 00:24:28,741
LoRA 属于重参数化
LoRA is a reparameterization.

383
00:24:28,982 --> 00:24:30,297
先从小的说起
Start small.

384
00:24:30,347 --> 00:24:33,377
一个 5 乘 5 的矩阵有 25 个数
A 5 by 5 matrix has 25 numbers.

385
00:24:33,697 --> 00:24:36,825
一个 5 乘 1 的列乘以一个 1 乘 5 的行
A 5 by 1 column times a 1 by 5 row

386
00:24:36,825 --> 00:24:41,334
也能得到 5 乘 5 的矩阵，只用 10 个数
also makes a 5 by 5 matrix, from only 10 numbers.

387
00:24:41,654 --> 00:24:44,086
这就是秩为 1；秩为 2 需要 20 个
That's rank 1; rank 2 needs 20.

388
00:24:44,406 --> 00:24:46,497
在这个尺寸上，几乎省不了什么
At this size it's barely a saving.

389
00:24:46,732 --> 00:24:48,524
到了真实尺寸，就不一样了
At real size it's different.

390
00:24:48,844 --> 00:24:56,033
Qwen 的 query 投影，是 2048 乘 1024 的矩阵：200 多万个数
Qwen's query projection is a 2,048 by 1,024 matrix: over 2 million numbers.

391
00:24:56,353 --> 00:24:59,881
秩为 8 的一对细条
A rank 8 pair of strips,

392
00:24:59,881 --> 00:25:05,761
2048 乘 8 和 8 乘 1024，一共 24576 个数
2,048 by 8 and 8 by 1,024, holds 24,576.

393
00:25:07,999 --> 00:25:10,986
所以 LoRA 分解的是更新量，不是权重
So LoRA decomposes the update, not the weights.

394
00:25:11,306 --> 00:25:14,334
新的这一层，就是冻结的 W₀
The new layer is the frozen W₀,

395
00:25:14,334 --> 00:25:16,874
加上 alpha 除以 r，再乘以 B 乘 A
plus α/r, times B times A.

396
00:25:17,194 --> 00:25:19,007
只训练 B 和 A
Only B and A are trained.

397
00:25:19,249 --> 00:25:21,681
B 从 0 开始，A 随机初始化
B starts at zero and A at random.

398
00:25:22,001 --> 00:25:27,633
课上从正态分布里取 A；这个库用的是均匀分布
The lecture draws A from a normal distribution; the library uses a uniform one.

399
00:25:27,953 --> 00:25:31,601
关键是 B 乘 A 一开始正好是 0
What matters is that B times A starts at exactly zero,

400
00:25:31,601 --> 00:25:34,844
所以第 0 步的模型就是预训练的那个
so at step zero the model is the pretrained one.

401
00:25:35,164 --> 00:25:36,998
两个分支的输出相加
Both branches' outputs add.

402
00:25:37,232 --> 00:25:42,562
接下来是 notebook 的第 4 步，LoRA 配置：alpha 16，秩 8
Now the notebook's step 4, the LoRA config: alpha 16 and rank 8,

403
00:25:42,562 --> 00:25:48,475
所以更新量缩放 2 倍，再加上 0.1 的 dropout 做正则化
so the update is scaled by 2, plus a dropout of 0.1 for regularization.

404
00:25:48,795 --> 00:25:50,395
暂停一下，跑一遍
Pause and run it.

405
00:25:52,182 --> 00:25:53,519
哪些层？
Which layers?

406
00:25:53,569 --> 00:25:57,244
配置里没有写 target modules。所以对 Qwen3
The config names no target_modules. So for Qwen3,

407
00:25:57,244 --> 00:26:02,150
PEFT 库的默认设置改的是 query 投影和 value 投影
the PEFT library's default adapts the query and value projections:

408
00:26:02,150 --> 00:26:05,942
28 层里每一层七个矩阵中的两个
two of the seven matrices in each of the 28 blocks.

409
00:26:06,262 --> 00:26:13,793
也就是每层 40960 个，一共 1146880 个
That's 40,960 per block, 1,146,880 in all.

410
00:26:14,032 --> 00:26:17,662
课上的表把整个模型当成一个方形的层
The lecture's table treats a whole model as one square layer;

411
00:26:17,662 --> 00:26:19,984
真实的数量取决于这些形状
the real count depends on these shapes.

412
00:26:20,304 --> 00:26:21,904
现在，你自己试试
Now, try it yourself.

413
00:26:30,615 --> 00:26:36,439
秩为 16 会翻倍，变成 2293760
Rank 16 doubles it, to 2,293,760.

414
00:26:36,759 --> 00:26:42,903
七个投影矩阵全用秩 8，是 5046272
All seven projections at rank 8 give 5,046,272.

415
00:26:43,223 --> 00:26:46,770
秩越大，容量越大，代价是更多的显存和时间
More rank buys capacity at more memory and time;

416
00:26:46,770 --> 00:26:50,540
做人设的话，两个投影矩阵上用秩 8 就够了
for a persona, rank 8 on two projections is plenty.

417
00:26:50,860 --> 00:26:54,103
要试的话，先在 1.3 重新加载模型
To try it, reload the model in 1.3 first.

418
00:26:55,448 --> 00:26:59,437
回到显存柱，按 Qwen 的大小，用我们自己的估算
Back to the memory column, at Qwen's size, by our own estimate.

419
00:26:59,757 --> 00:27:04,351
全参数微调大约要 7 GB，还没算激活值
Full fine-tuning would need about 7 gigabytes before activations;

420
00:27:04,351 --> 00:27:06,541
这个 notebook 的 QLoRA，不到 1 GB
this notebook's QLoRA, under 1.

421
00:27:06,861 --> 00:27:12,003
参数只有 6 亿的话，就算全参数微调，也放得进一块 T4
At 0.6 billion parameters, even full fine-tuning would fit a T4.

422
00:27:12,323 --> 00:27:13,585
这套配方之所以重要
The recipe matters

423
00:27:13,585 --> 00:27:16,739
是因为同一个 notebook 能扩展到放不进去的模型
because the same notebook scales to models that wouldn't.

424
00:27:17,981 --> 00:27:20,589
剩下的显存给了激活值
The rest of the memory goes to activations,

425
00:27:20,589 --> 00:27:25,320
也就是每一层在前向时算出来的值，留给反向传播用
the values each layer computes on the way forward, kept for the backward pass.

426
00:27:25,640 --> 00:27:28,177
梯度检查点只保留少数几个
Gradient checkpointing keeps only a few

427
00:27:28,177 --> 00:27:32,275
其余的在需要时重新计算：用计算换显存
and recomputes the rest when needed: compute traded for memory.

428
00:27:32,515 --> 00:27:35,374
第 4.2 节，训练参数
Section 4.2, the training arguments.

429
00:27:35,694 --> 00:27:40,175
序列最长 512 个 token，按长度分组
Sequences are capped at 512 tokens and grouped by length:

430
00:27:40,175 --> 00:27:45,912
2 个 epoch，batch 大小为 4，学习率是 2 乘 10 的负 4 次方
2 epochs, batches of 4, and a learning rate of 2 times 10 to the minus 4.

431
00:27:46,232 --> 00:27:49,262
优化器是分页的 32 位 Adam
The optimizer is a paged 32-bit Adam.

432
00:27:49,582 --> 00:27:54,574
分页会在 GPU 显存满了的时候，把优化器状态挪到 CPU 内存里
Paging moves optimizer state to CPU memory when the GPU fills up.

433
00:27:54,894 --> 00:27:56,494
我们的用不着
Ours never needs to.

434
00:27:58,631 --> 00:28:01,703
然后打开 fp16，关掉 bf16
Then fp16 on and bf16 off.

435
00:28:02,023 --> 00:28:06,234
BF16 保留了 FP32 的范围但精度低一些
BF16 keeps the range of float 32 with less precision,

436
00:28:06,234 --> 00:28:08,935
课上做 QLoRA 用的就是它
and the lecture uses it for QLoRA.

437
00:28:09,255 --> 00:28:14,802
T4 没有快速的 BF16，所以这个 notebook 用 FP16 计算
The T4 has no fast BF16, so this notebook computes in FP16.

438
00:28:15,048 --> 00:28:17,181
第 4.3 节构建 trainer
4.3 builds the trainer.

439
00:28:17,501 --> 00:28:20,619
这个 trainer 会把 adapter 转成 BF16
The trainer turns the adapters into BF16,

440
00:28:20,619 --> 00:28:26,397
而 FP16 训练处理不了 BF16，所以这个单元格把它们转回 FP32
which FP16 training cannot handle, so this cell casts them back to float 32.

441
00:28:26,717 --> 00:28:31,038
而且这个数字证实了我们的算术
And the count confirms our arithmetic:

442
00:28:31,038 --> 00:28:36,040
1146880 个可训练参数，占 0.3%
1,146,880 trainable parameters, 0.3 percent.

443
00:28:36,281 --> 00:28:42,446
在反向传播里，梯度会往下穿过 W₀，只有 B 和 A 被更新
In the backward pass, the gradient flows down through W₀, and only B and A are updated.

444
00:28:42,766 --> 00:28:48,100
W₀ 在往下传的时候会用到；只是它得不到梯度，也不会被更新
W₀ is used on the way down; it just gets no gradient and no update.

445
00:28:48,348 --> 00:28:52,630
第 4.4 节，训练：900 个样本，batch 大小为 4
4.4, train: 900 examples in batches of 4

446
00:28:52,630 --> 00:28:55,413
跑 2 个 epoch，就是 450 步
for 2 epochs is 450 steps,

447
00:28:55,413 --> 00:29:00,444
在保存的 A100 运行里用了 3 分 36 秒
3 minutes and 36 seconds on the saved A100 run.

448
00:29:00,764 --> 00:29:03,537
这个 notebook 说，在 T4 上要 6 到 7 分钟
The notebook says 6 to 7 minutes on a T4.

449
00:29:03,857 --> 00:29:07,569
这个 loss 从 2.0 降到了 1.35
The loss falls from 2.0 to 1.35.

450
00:29:07,889 --> 00:29:12,113
还有第 4.5 节，TensorBoard 会在你自己的运行里显示这些曲线
And 4.5, TensorBoard, shows these curves in your own run.

451
00:29:12,433 --> 00:29:14,033
暂停一下，开始训练
Pause and train.

452
00:29:16,932 --> 00:29:20,367
有效吗？第 5.1 节来衡量
Did it work? Section 5.1 measures it.

453
00:29:20,687 --> 00:29:24,336
困惑度就是平均每个 token 的 loss 取指数
Perplexity is the exponential of the average token loss:

454
00:29:24,336 --> 00:29:29,028
大致相当于模型在多少个等可能的下一个 token 里做选择
roughly how many equally likely next tokens the model is choosing among.

455
00:29:29,815 --> 00:29:34,079
在 100 个测试样本、30681 个 token 上
On 100 test examples, 30,681 tokens,

456
00:29:34,079 --> 00:29:41,186
基座模型的 loss 是 2.65，困惑度 14.15
the base model has a loss of 2.65 and a perplexity of 14.15.

457
00:29:41,506 --> 00:29:45,815
微调后的模型：loss 1.39，困惑度 4
The fine-tuned model: 1.39, and a perplexity of 4.

458
00:29:46,065 --> 00:29:49,926
基座那一行，就是同一个模型放在 disable adapter 里
The base row is the same model inside disable_adapter().

459
00:29:50,246 --> 00:29:56,668
把 adapter 关掉，原来的 4 位模型就回来了，因为 W₀ 从来没变
Switch the adapter off and the original model, in 4 bits, is back, because W₀ never changed.

460
00:29:56,988 --> 00:30:03,180
这正是课上讲灾难性遗忘时的要点，也就是学新本事时丢了旧本事
That's the lecture's point about catastrophic forgetting, losing old skills while learning new ones:

461
00:30:03,180 --> 00:30:05,905
用 LoRA 的话，原来的模型只差一个开关
with LoRA, the old model is one switch away.

462
00:30:06,149 --> 00:30:09,712
在保存的运行里，基座模型的每个回答都以 The 开头
In the saved run, every base answer starts with the word The.

463
00:30:10,032 --> 00:30:13,028
微调后的回答以 welcome 或 Yello 开头
The fine-tuned ones start with welcome or Yello,

464
00:30:13,028 --> 00:30:15,088
也就是它训练数据里的开场白
the openers of its training data.

465
00:30:15,408 --> 00:30:19,653
那些柱子只是示意；实测的数字就在旁边
Those bars are an illustration; the measured numbers sit beside them.

466
00:30:19,899 --> 00:30:21,499
这个下降衡量的是什么？
What does the drop measure?

467
00:30:21,712 --> 00:30:25,446
这个 loss 算的是每一个 token，连问题和模板也算在内
The loss counts every token, questions and template included.

468
00:30:25,766 --> 00:30:31,099
它说明这种风格是模型现在预期的，而不是它的回答更正确了
It says this style is what the model now expects, not that its answers are more correct.

469
00:30:31,349 --> 00:30:33,376
第 5.2 节比较回答
5.2 compares answers.

470
00:30:33,696 --> 00:30:37,495
两个奶酪问题的回答现在都以 welcome welcome welcome
Both cheese answers now open with welcome welcome welcome,

471
00:30:37,495 --> 00:30:40,181
cheese lovers 开头，用的是授课老师的口吻
cheese lovers, in the instructor's voice.

472
00:30:40,501 --> 00:30:43,829
再看天空：口吻学过去了，物理没有
And the sky: the voice transferred, the physics did not.

473
00:30:44,149 --> 00:30:46,047
暂停一下，跑完第 5 节
Pause, and run section 5.

474
00:30:48,282 --> 00:30:49,747
两点友情提示
Two kind notes.

475
00:30:49,797 --> 00:30:53,225
在这次比较里，基座是一个全新的 16 位模型
In this comparison the base is a fresh 16-bit model,

476
00:30:53,225 --> 00:30:57,050
不是表里那个 4 位的，所以两个基线不一样
not the 4-bit one from the table, so the baselines differ.

477
00:30:57,370 --> 00:31:02,311
另外，课上展示了 LoRA 在一个公开的基准测试上追平全参数微调
And the lecture shows LoRA matching full fine-tuning on a published benchmark;

478
00:31:02,311 --> 00:31:05,669
这个 notebook 衡量的是风格契合度，不是回答质量
this notebook measures style fit, not answer quality.

479
00:31:07,515 --> 00:31:09,648
这个 notebook 的第 6 步保存你的成果
The notebook's step 6 saves your work.

480
00:31:09,968 --> 00:31:17,542
先存 adapter：1146880 个数，用 FP32 存大约 4.6 MB
First the adapters: 1,146,880 numbers, about 4.6 megabytes in float 32,

481
00:31:17,542 --> 00:31:21,702
连同 tokenizer 一起存到你的 Drive
saved to your Drive with the tokenizer.

482
00:31:26,148 --> 00:31:27,442
然后是合并
Then the merge.

483
00:31:27,492 --> 00:31:31,365
这个 notebook 加载一份全新的 16 位基座副本
The notebook loads a fresh 16-bit copy of the base and adds

484
00:31:31,365 --> 00:31:32,965
把 B 乘 A 加进去
B times A into it.

485
00:31:33,167 --> 00:31:38,393
不是加进 4 位的权重里：在那里，更新量会被舍入回 16 个级别上
Not into the 4-bit weights: there, the update would round back onto 16 levels.

486
00:31:38,713 --> 00:31:41,785
合并后的模型大约 1.2 GB
The merged model is about 1.2 gigabytes.

487
00:31:42,105 --> 00:31:45,025
如果合并时报 torchao 的导入错误
If the merge raises a torchao ImportError,

488
00:31:45,025 --> 00:31:48,292
就重新运行安装单元格，再重启会话
rerun the install cell and restart the session.

489
00:31:50,532 --> 00:31:53,412
第 6.3 节可以把合并后的模型 push
Section 6.3 can push the merged model

490
00:31:53,412 --> 00:31:56,292
到一个私有的 Hugging Face repo
to a private Hugging Face repository.

491
00:31:56,612 --> 00:31:58,434
所以你可以交付三样东西
So you can ship three things:

492
00:31:58,434 --> 00:32:02,518
一个离不开基座的 adapter，一个能独立运行的合并模型
an adapter that needs its base, a merged model that stands alone,

493
00:32:02,518 --> 00:32:05,785
或者 Google 的 endpoint，权重不在你手里
or Google's endpoint, with no weights in your hands.

494
00:32:06,032 --> 00:32:12,005
清理。退出 container，用 docker image rm 删掉两个 image
Teardown. Exit the container and remove both images with docker image rm.

495
00:32:12,325 --> 00:32:14,864
删掉你的 bucket 里的数据集目录
Delete the dataset folder in your bucket.

496
00:32:15,184 --> 00:32:19,280
微调后的模型和 endpoint 留到第 10 讲，之后再删掉
Keep the tuned model and endpoint for lecture 10, then delete them.

497
00:32:19,600 --> 00:32:24,784
删掉没用的服务账号密钥，再断开并删除 Colab 运行时
Delete unused service account keys, and disconnect and delete the Colab runtime.

498
00:32:25,104 --> 00:32:26,704
暂停一下，把它们都清理掉
Pause, and tear down.

499
00:32:28,715 --> 00:32:30,222
回顾一下
Here's where we are.

500
00:32:30,272 --> 00:32:32,640
改 prompt 和做检索，变的是输入
Prompts and retrieval change the input;

501
00:32:32,640 --> 00:32:36,950
微调变的是权重，而这里它教会的是口吻，不是事实
fine-tuning changes the weights, and here it taught a voice, not facts.

502
00:32:37,270 --> 00:32:41,344
路线 A 里，教师模型写数据，Google 微调模型
In track A, a teacher wrote the data and Google tuned the model.

503
00:32:41,664 --> 00:32:44,891
路线 B 里，QLoRA 冻结了一个 4 位的基座
In track B, QLoRA froze a 4-bit base

504
00:32:44,891 --> 00:32:50,539
只训练两个细细的矩阵：120、40，再到 12 GB
and trained two thin matrices: 120, then 40, then 12 gigabytes.

505
00:32:54,382 --> 00:32:56,387
五道题，自测一下
Five questions to test yourself.

506
00:32:56,707 --> 00:32:59,331
这次微调改变了什么，没改变什么？
What did this fine-tune change, and what not?

507
00:32:59,651 --> 00:33:02,489
为什么 generate 在没有密钥时退出码也是 0？
Why did generate exit zero without a key?

508
00:33:02,809 --> 00:33:05,817
一组问答在变成模板的路上，要经过哪些形状？
Which shapes does one pair take on its way to the template?

509
00:33:06,137 --> 00:33:09,131
为什么 train 打印出来的是：Tuned model info: None？
Why does train print Tuned model info: None?

510
00:33:09,181 --> 00:33:14,030
还有，1146880 是怎么来的？
And where does 1,146,880 come from?

511
00:33:17,265 --> 00:33:19,129
接下来，第 9 讲测试代码
Next, lecture 9 tests code,

512
00:33:19,129 --> 00:33:22,236
第 10 讲会有一个应用调用你的 endpoint
and in lecture 10 an app calls your endpoint.

513
00:33:22,556 --> 00:33:26,396
学习指南和练习都在 MLOps Learning 里
The study guide and the exercises are in MLOps_Learning.
